langid-rs 1.1.0 / py3langid
The Rust distribution of the byte n-gram model declares the MIT license.
Kamishibai retains selected language columns of the model and its original
feature automaton. The model comes from py3langid and langid.py.
https://github.com/frederik-uni/langid
